# 与仓库根目录 .gitignore 同一意图。单独拷贝本目录时仍然生效。
# 不要忽略全部 *.json / *.csv，避免挡住 --map、--known 和 tests 里的文本夹具。

.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
secrets.json

.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.log
logs/
*.tmp
*.bak

*.dwg
*.dxf
*.dwt
*.dws
*.dwl
*.dwl2
*.sv$
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.pdf
*.count.txt
*.fingerprint.txt
*.windows.txt
*.detailcheck.txt
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
out/
output/
*_out/

# 合成测试夹具若以后放在 tests/ 下，保持可提交。
!tests/**/*.dxf
!tests/**/*.json
!tests/**/*.csv
!tests/**/*.png

*.exe
*.msi
*.msix
*.appimage
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.deb
*.rpm
oda_file_converter/
ODAFileConverter*/
DwgExporter*/
render_crop.py
*.zip

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
